[Shizu] What?

947
00:44:45,308 --> 00:44:47,268
-[Umi] What the heck is this?
-Whoa, what's this?

948
00:44:47,351 --> 00:44:48,603
This is remarkable.

949
00:44:48,686 --> 00:44:49,854
Amazing!

950
00:44:52,315 --> 00:44:53,566
This can't be real.

951
00:44:57,028 --> 00:44:58,029
Whoa!

952
00:44:58,112 --> 00:44:59,113
[Chaka] Is it a river?

953
00:44:59,739 --> 00:45:00,740
[Umi] Must be.

954
00:45:01,365 --> 00:45:02,617
[Shizu whoops]

955
00:45:03,492 --> 00:45:04,827
[Chaka] What an incredible view.

956
00:45:04,911 --> 00:45:08,080
-How on earth did this come to be?
-[Shizu laughs]

957
00:45:08,164 --> 00:45:10,082
-This must be what Grand Canyon is like…
-What a sight.

958
00:45:10,166 --> 00:45:11,500
-…though I've never been.
-Yeah.

959
00:45:12,210 --> 00:45:14,587
-The water carved the canyon.
-I wonder what this river is called.

960
00:45:15,087 --> 00:45:16,881
Is that sand, or rocks in front of us?

961
00:45:16,964 --> 00:45:17,965
-I can't tell.
-Yeah.

962
00:45:18,049 --> 00:45:20,468
The river must have reached
this high at one point.

963
00:45:20,551 --> 00:45:21,552
Maybe.

964
00:45:21,636 --> 00:45:22,929
[Shizu] This is unreal.

965
00:45:26,182 --> 00:45:28,184
[♪ epic music continues]

966
00:45:35,149 --> 00:45:36,150
[♪ music ends]

967
00:45:40,196 --> 00:45:41,572
[hissing]

968
00:45:41,656 --> 00:45:43,658
[♪ funky music playing]

969
00:45:50,998 --> 00:45:52,792
[Noel] Don't be amazed just yet.

970
00:45:52,875 --> 00:45:54,835
There's an even more majestic view
waiting up ahead.

971
00:46:00,216 --> 00:46:01,217
Right there.

972
00:46:02,301 --> 00:46:03,302
It's coming into view.

973
00:46:04,387 --> 00:46:06,722
That over there is Monument Valley.

974
00:46:09,642 --> 00:46:13,479
There, a sight the members
have never seen unfolds.

975
00:47:21,756 --> 00:47:23,758
Translated by Megumi Hunter
